        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Yarbo Lawn Mower Pro Module attaches to your Yarbo Core and turns it into a heavy-duty autonomous mower built for large, demanding lawns. No boundary wires, no manual mowing, no lawn service.</p><p><strong>Power and Precision</strong><br/>Dual 300W motors deliver 2,500W peak power, twice the standard motor output. Cutting height adjusts from 0.8\" to 4.0\" across 20 settings.</p><p><strong>Built for Real Lawns</strong><br/>Covers up to 6 acres on a twice-weekly mowing cycle. Handles Bermuda, Zoysia, St. Augustine, Buffalo Grass, and Kikuyu. Choose reinforced cutting discs or SK85 high-carbon steel straight blades depending on your lawn.</p><p><strong>Smart Obstacle Detection</strong><br/>Binocular camera, ultrasonic radar, and a front bumper sensor work together to navigate safely around pets, furniture, and obstacles.</p><p>Requires Yarbo Core — sold separately or as part of a bundle.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>Cuts what other robots can't.</strong></p><p>The Lawn Mower Pro Module upgrades your Yarbo Core into a heavy-duty autonomous mower, engineered for large and demanding properties, fully autonomous, every cut.</p><p><strong>Requires a Yarbo Core to run.</strong> This module needs a Core base to operate. If you don’t already own one, a bundle like the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> includes a Core and gets you running immediately.</p><h3>Built for demanding lawns</h3><p>Dual 300W motors and 2,500W peak power cut through thick, tall, and difficult grass without slowing down.</p><h3>Works with the Core’s all-terrain chassis</h3><p>The module relies on the Core’s tracked drive system and 70% (35°) climbing ability to take on slopes and rough ground that stop wheeled mowers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Yarbo’s standard 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, beginning from the date your machine is activated. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Setup takes approximately 60 to 90 minutes. The Yarbo app guides you through boundary mapping using RTK GPS, no physical wire installation required. Compatible with iOS and Android.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Lawn Mower Pro Module</h3><ul><li><strong>Motors:</strong> Dual 300W, 2,500W peak power</li><li><strong>Cutting height:</strong> 0.8 to 4.0 inches</li><li><strong>Max mowing size:</strong> Up to 6 acres (25,000 m²)</li><li><strong>Mowing area per day:</strong> Up to 1.7 acres (6,880 m²)</li><li><strong>Grass compatibility:</strong> Bermuda, Zoysia, St. Augustine, Buffalo Grass, Kikuyu</li><li><strong>Blade options:</strong> Standard reinforced cutting discs (5 reinforced razor blades each) or SK85 high-carbon steel straight blades</li><li><strong>Obstacle detection:</strong> Binocular camera + ultrasonic radar + bumper sensor</li></ul><h3>Yarbo Core (required, sold separately)</h3><ul><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM</li><li><strong>Climbing ability:</strong> 70% (35°)</li><li><strong>Battery capacity:</strong> 36V 38.4Ah</li><li><strong>Mowing time per charge:</strong> Up to 120 minutes</li><li><strong>Charging time (20%–80%):</strong> 90 minutes</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow</li></ul><h3>Warranty &amp; Shipping</h3><ul><li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Yarbo's standard 2-year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, from activation date</li><li><strong>Delivery:</strong> approximately 10 to 14 days after payment</li></ul><h3>What's in the Box</h3><ul><li>Lawn Mower Pro Module</li><li>Mounting hardware &amp; install guide</li><li>Quick-start card</li></ul><p>Requires a Yarbo Core, sold separately or as part of a bundle.</p>"
          }
        },
