        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .ylm-stack { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px; text-align: center; } @media screen and (max-width: 749px) { .ylm-stack { padding: 40px 20px; } }\n  .ylm-stack__frame { border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(35,39,57,.10); background: #fff; margin: 0 0 28px; }\n  .ylm-stack__frame img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .ylm-stack__kicker { display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c9a84c; margin: 0 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #c9a84c; }\n  .ylm-stack__heading { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px); font-weight: 700; color: #233923; margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.2; }\n  .ylm-stack__text { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #233923; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 560px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"ylm-stack\">\n  <div class=\"ylm-stack__frame\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0965/2056/9136/files/Yarbo_MPRO_1.png?v=1787779908\" alt=\"Yarbo Core and Lawn Mower Pro Module shown separately, ready to attach\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\">\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"ylm-stack__kicker\">One Base, Modules That Swap</span>\n  <h2 class=\"ylm-stack__heading\">Attaches to the Core You Already Own</h2>\n  <p class=\"ylm-stack__text\">The Lawn Mower Pro Module is not its own robot, it's the mowing half of a modular system. It mounts to the Yarbo Core's tracked chassis, and when the season changes, it comes back off just as easily so a Snow Blower or Leaf Blower module can take its place.</p>\n</div>"
