            "column_1_image": "shopify://shop_images/Yarbo_M1_8.png",
            "column_1_label": "The Grass Doesn't Get a Vote Anymore",
            "column_1_text": "Dense, wet, three-weeks-overgrown, it used to decide when you'd deal with it. Now the dual 300W motors decide, and they never say not today.",
            "column_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/Yarbo_M1_6_2590bbc0-bad0-47ce-883f-4bd2101db6bc.png",
            "column_2_label": "Precision Is a Setting, Not a Skill",
            "column_2_text": "Standard reinforced discs when you just want it handled. Straight blades when you want a finer cut that feeds the lawn instead of sitting on top of it. Either way, you didn't have to learn a thing.",
            "column_3_image": "shopify://shop_images/Yarbo_MPRO_8_56754369-1c0b-49b8-8c64-c1c3a3c28248.png",
            "column_3_label": "You'll Forget This Is Even Running",
            "column_3_text": "RTK-GPS plans it, the sensors run it, the Core docks itself when it's done. The only proof it happened is a lawn that looks like it always does now, perfect.",
            "label_size": 20,
