            "column_1_label": "Every Pass Does More Work",
            "column_1_description": "A wider cutting path means fewer passes across the same ground. On a large property, that difference compounds, less time running, more of the yard finished before you've thought to check.",
            "column_2_image": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_2036457959.webp",
            "column_2_label": "Built to Outlast the Conditions",
            "column_2_description": "Reinforced blades that hold up under repeated, demanding use. Fewer replacements, less maintenance, a machine that keeps performing the way it did on day one.",
